{"id":4038,"date":"2025-05-31T00:07:57","date_gmt":"2025-05-31T00:07:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4038"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:29:20","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:29:20","slug":"tick-xanh-tiktok-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/tick-xanh-tiktok-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"Tick xanh TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec? C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"V1kAdQSPboO3G0xThK8lTQfIg8f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3VjdsPsYoH6D2xh152lszqdggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng x\u00e1c minh t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn, nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. C\u1ea7n nhi\u1ec1u follower, n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">Lemon Digital<\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQrIdMZ5moepB1xqIiil9Wtkg3d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VdIkd0aWCogUTJxSiFTlfutWgIe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZthdSPLLojMwaxNzYWlv66Cgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tick xanh TikTok (d\u1ea5u x\u00e1c minh m\u00e0u xanh) l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb b\u00ean c\u1ea1nh t\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, cho bi\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok x\u00e1c minh ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c. Th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng, tick xanh gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n th\u1eadt, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Esald21I9ofSTVxHBFVloyz3gWh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4042\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4042\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4042\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2.png\" alt=\"T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4042\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"V1kAdQSPboO3G0xThK8lTQfIg8f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZRlBdMTYRojuiMxrVnvlbjFDgc5\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 tick xanh TikTok<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LkajdDgyAok1YGxFVdWlAaF4gUh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng uy t\u00edn: Gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem tin t\u01b0\u1edfng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLlXdOQMuozOQ1xcJFRlCKmfgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>D\u1ec5 l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng: TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean trang &#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEmJdNKzYo3lz5xKE6XlrrWPgth\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u00f3a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u: Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi KOL, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUMRdyHXIoQwiyxVnvAlCLHZgKc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c: \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00e3n h\u00e0ng ch\u00fa \u00fd, d\u1ec5 nh\u1eadn job h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxsrdBOADo6TJIx86FClJOMVgcb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 kh\u1ecfi gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o: TikTok h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u1eed l\u00fd nhanh khi b\u1ecb sao ch\u00e9p danh t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TXtCdm0L3oAJywxopM4lFazvg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-T7a8dmDKnoV4H1x1z6sllg8fgIh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn t\u00edch xanh tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 99.542%; height: 312px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"252;641\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"252\" \/>\n<col width=\"641\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 24px; width: 35.6439%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CV7MduJXjoX8nLxzqIVludF5gm6\"><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i T\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 24px; width: 74.3016%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JnaYdSHmnoWhauxE6CXlz3jYgce\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec1u Ki\u1ec7n <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left; width: 35.6439%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ug02d2XbQogjI0x4IqelewyxgMe\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left; width: 74.3016%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QtZ9dRedHo0Yj7xOn2KlGQWlgFc\">&#8211; C\u00f3 \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 2 tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i ho\u1eb7c t\u1ed5ng 25 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u00edch tr\u00ean t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 video.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mz1DdDAc4olAQDxyRnQlUf2egSd\">&#8211; \u0110\u0103ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 3 video m\u1ed7i tu\u1ea7n v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb l\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fgtddm072oChZkxDrwZl5fXxgFf\">&#8211; Tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a TikTok trong \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 3 th\u00e1ng li\u00ean t\u1ee5c<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 96px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left; width: 35.6439%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OhWcdo9ngo2gWCxbcVBlrjR8gLg\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 tick xanh tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c (Facebook, YouTube, Instagram)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left; width: 74.3016%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PKh8d0pk1o5be1x1dSrlBkKag3c\">&#8211; C\u00f3 \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 500.000 ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HlSOdhsxcoeeKrxIIYVlc5nQgdf\">&#8211; \u0110\u0103ng \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 12 video m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 8 video l\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c trong v\u00f2ng 2 th\u00e1ng li\u00ean t\u1ee5c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WM2rdpakYotEHwxqk25lEPpSgwz\">&#8211; N\u1ed9i dung kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px; text-align: left; width: 35.6439%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LY1hd6GMJoGXgKx69NKlxutmgbd\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a TikTok<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px; text-align: left; width: 74.3016%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLHydChsGoI2BXxAz9RlWMeFgVb\">&#8211; C\u00f3 \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 30.000 ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpuldYZtkoITAuxTUYNlXWpAg7f\">&#8211; Chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng \u00edt nh\u1ea5t m\u1ed9t s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n do TikTok t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left; width: 35.6439%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RlT0dX72Roccy7x35YslGs6qgre\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left; width: 74.3016%;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SztNdwdpwogR9WxegfslnC6Sg7e\">&#8211; Cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u00e1p l\u00fd li\u00ean quan.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEGWd5e5PoyZgDxYcn1lnnwDgIh\">&#8211; T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LJvTd3K7Hozq4Gx0rIslbd9Eg7e\">&#8211; Tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 c\u00e1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 lu\u1eadt ph\u00e1p li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-J4jLdshfjozd5qxjIOUlNvxnguf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E5c8dO7h7oWliJxzkLflGRfogue\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; TikTok kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tick xanh, thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ebd ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u1ea5p tick xanh cho nh\u1eefng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, c\u00f3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I58zdbFNmoqNLBx3b1lljNlzg7f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; \u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t, h\u00e3y h\u00e3y t\u1eadp trung x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i, duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c v\u00e0 tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4044\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2.png\" alt=\"T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea1t tick xanh \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea1t tick xanh<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div data-page-id=\"V1kAdQSPboO3G0xThK8lTQfIg8f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EoPxdWUfzoKt9lxAmvulWlGPgCg\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00edch xanh tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THfpdF4anoZ7mkxyL6wlJKhtgFd\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00dd:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THfpdF4anoZ7mkxyL6wlJKhtgFd\">TikTok kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u1ef1 do \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tick xanh nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c. Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, TikTok s\u1ebd ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u1ea5p tick xanh cho nh\u1eefng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, nh\u01b0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u hay KOL.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CY4wdzKWLoPiykxwW24liv2bgme\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129 ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p l\u1edbn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ho\u1eb7c g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00e1c minh qua k\u00eanh ri\u00eang. V\u00ec v\u1eady,\u00a0 d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y s\u1ebd l\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 TikTok t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u1ea5p d\u1ea5u x\u00e1c minh cho b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUBAdVxptotKGVx7LeplneAlgHe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1A6dhbscoat9Nxd6VXllSe8gBj\"><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc g\u1eedi \u0111\u01a1n y\u00eau c\u1ea7u t\u00edch xanh TikTok<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1A6dhbscoat9Nxd6VXllSe8gBj\">D\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn form \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd (th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i l\u1edbn ho\u1eb7c qua c\u00e1c k\u00eanh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t):<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jk1rdu5w2oZSx4xW7BXlT0lBg4e\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFLedSu8UoZf3bxjigylIDgUgmf\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok: <\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K3DrdaL6OoZHHJxOkcBlTIPUg5c\">\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c, c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u1ee7 l\u1edbn (th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb 500.000 ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i tr\u00ean TikTok.). B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok, kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n hay quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PFttdOK9soMSEAxkBb1lGnEjg3f\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp link t\u1eeb MCN ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c partner \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00edch xanh <\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kg6Id67pJoOIsgxujLMlfDW5gTg\">Ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o form \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd. Nh\u01b0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng TikTok kh\u00f4ng m\u1edf c\u00f4ng khai form n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BhzAdecY2oY6tHxFwPWlpTETgGd\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: \u0110i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWXbdhbZ8oapC7xJkZTlYu9PgS1\">Cung c\u1ea5p t\u00ean \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, username TikTok, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QqW6dVwskonFjbxgOvWlhiYNgIc\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: T\u1ea3i l\u00ean gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd x\u00e1c minh<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bo5UdOu5qotQljxOKH2lA7rHgHe\">G\u1eedi k\u00e8m gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd t\u00f9y th\u00e2n (CMND\/CCCD, h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu) ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh n\u1ebfu l\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L14NdPYNdo4n1RxmMh7lyPa9gnv\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: M\u00f4 t\u1ea3 l\u00fd do mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c minh<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0nNdAJUPo7Atmxnqr4lRiHAgqc\">Vi\u1ebft ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn v\u1ec1 l\u00fd do b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n d\u1ea5u t\u00edch xanh, nh\u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh s\u1ef1 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 t\u00ednh x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UYkfdhacsoGUcZxWAzGl42Y2gxh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: G\u1eedi \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0 ch\u1edd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N7FmdkNqlou8rbxaHNvlZumBguh\">Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o n\u00fat \u201cG\u1eedi\u201d v\u00e0 ch\u1edd ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb TikTok trong kho\u1ea3ng 24 gi\u1edd.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4043\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4043\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4043\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2.png\" alt=\"S\u1edf h\u1eefu t\u00edch xanh - T\u1ea1o d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4043\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1edf h\u1eefu t\u00edch xanh &#8211; T\u1ea1o d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"V1kAdQSPboO3G0xThK8lTQfIg8f\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SlrhdatEAoj3fdxveZQlGMklgMf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng sai l\u1ea7m c\u1ea7n tr\u00e1nh khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00edch xanh.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PwgodCczjourByxhD1glDQrAgic\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o: G\u00e2y m\u1ea5t uy t\u00edn, d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DIe6dFas0opDeVxv4cClBTv7goF\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Kh\u00f4ng chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ee7 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd x\u00e1c minh h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7: Thi\u1ebfu CMND\/CCCD, gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh,&#8230; s\u1ebd l\u00e0m h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 b\u1ecb lo\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zj2mdBcoZoh7wZxD73Eldb9tg0f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok: Bao g\u1ed3m sao ch\u00e9p, n\u1ed9i dung ph\u1ea3n c\u1ea3m, b\u1ea1o l\u1ef1c, vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TVDqdMgBsoIb5BxVmDulyuzEgvh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Kh\u00f4ng duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean tr\u00ean TikTok: \u00cdt \u0111\u0103ng video, kh\u00f4ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c khi\u1ebfn TikTok \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 th\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EQVJdry7Bo9Tu0xLUpMliSCYgRg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; G\u1eedi nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 trong th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb kh\u00f3a ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 kh\u00f4ng nghi\u00eam t\u00fac.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FrhpdoUVGo8OtkxfUTel0QgggUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; K\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng qu\u00e1 cao v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 c\u00e0ng: Tick xanh kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng, c\u1ea7n th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MaLUdO8o8oQxuWxqxNClv32sgjg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng sai l\u1ea7m tr\u00ean, c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadn t\u00edch xanh s\u1ebd cao h\u01a1n nhi\u1ec1u!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkrtdA48dobOx4xWA9blMPu1g5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ToWzdBz5ioJ490xjpziludzwgJe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p t\u00edch xanh?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LJHhdCA9nok8bTxOO17lY7VogMg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p t\u00edch xanh, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n, \u0111\u0103ng video \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 3\u20135 video m\u1ed7i tu\u1ea7n. Vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i th\u1eadt v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng, tr\u00e1nh mua follow ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c \u1ea3o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1AidK7Vioph9fxTZd7lhjsggwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n c\u0169ng n\u00ean tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a TikTok, tr\u00e1nh vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m. K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u1edbi c\u00e1c m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb video gi\u00fap m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ph\u1ea1m vi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn. Ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u1edbi \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u0169ng g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n n\u00e2ng cao uy t\u00edn. Tham gia c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, th\u1eed th\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok v\u00e0 gi\u1eef cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n minh b\u1ea1ch, kh\u00f4ng gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o hay m\u1ea1o danh ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c s\u1ebd gi\u00fap TikTok d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn th\u1ea5y b\u1ea1n x\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5p t\u00edch xanh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SoxndLxzDoFi0axA2WBlzWbpgYg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi li\u00ean quan<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4045\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4045\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4045\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1.png\" alt=\"Q&amp;A\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/27-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4045\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi li\u00ean quan<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-F4IgdgTHDoHNKZxYkfFlHZTmgHh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ai c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00edch xanh TikTok?<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tue6dHDZuov9d9xQd0Vl9gqhgTh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean c\u1ea5p t\u00edch xanh cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 500.000 ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i tr\u1edf l\u00ean, th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, KOL, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SX8mdJ3ZKorjuEx4WlVlDXSIgue\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>M\u1ea5t bao l\u00e2u \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5p t\u00edch xanh TikTok?<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GYpddOngMo7i6fxpV36lW29agLd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eddi gian x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t t\u00edch xanh th\u01b0\u1eddng dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 7 \u0111\u1ebfn 30 ng\u00e0y, t\u00f9y v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ed9 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn c\u1ee7a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QfqQdsXMqopu1ZxUWwflDTAJgyh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>N\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00edch xanh r\u1ed3i, c\u00f3 b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpdYdeyf4oICzMxQbbflICIgggg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1ea5t t\u00edch xanh n\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok, gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn. TikTok c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thu h\u1ed3i d\u1ea5u x\u00e1c minh b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 l\u00fac n\u00e0o khi ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n vi ph\u1ea1m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wrn9dRT9gooLhNxkrfhlNB6Ng6e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-GjWvdFmlLolUg3xiRlNlAqpLgpd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;abac3252-811c-4305-b9f8-99e846cd3fac&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCDudb9cZZoYnTcx9lfplER6xgKp%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CDudb9cZZoYnTcx9lfplER6xgKp&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RtQFdfUXSo64qrx19s0ldJuJg5f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgVadBUjzo1nfUxOLYtleu14gSf\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WMpadrKe5oV3wDx3POjlXaybgRg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BY3Ndf1L3oNN8JxVE0clHO36god\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TAIKd9Xooo1uQ9x5BbjlfMl5gee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JZrwdUeANogJVuxDx6JlW5KRg8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng x\u00e1c minh t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn, nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. C\u1ea7n nhi\u1ec1u follower, n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. C\u00f9ng Lemon Digital kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi. \u00a0 T\u00edch xanh TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec? Tick xanh TikTok (d\u1ea5u x\u00e1c minh [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4754,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,29],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4038","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc","category-kien-thuc-tiktok"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4038","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"